.TH strlist_dump 3
.SH NAME
strlist_dump \- debug dump of a string list
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strlist.h"
.PP
.BI "void strlist_dump(buffer *" out ", const strlist *" sl ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strlist_dump
writes a structured, debug-friendly representation of the string list
.I sl
to the buffer
.IR out .